The apps are free to use. They are not free to take.


WHAT YOU MAY DO

  - Clone this repository, follow its pointers, and build and use any of the
    apps on any computer you own or use, for as long as you like, without paying
    anything and without signing up for anything.
  - Read the source code published in those repositories, and learn whatever you
    like from reading it.
  - Tell anyone you like about them, and link them here.


